      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Frequently Asked Questions",
      "id": "faq",
      "intro": "Temukan jawaban atas berbagai pertanyaan umum seputar manajemen template dan mesin penjadwalan Jasper Report di sistem ShiFor.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Apa itu file JRXML dan bagaimana cara mendesainnya?",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **JRXML (.jrxml)** adalah file markup berbasis XML yang mendefinisikan struktur, query, variabel, dan elemen tata letak visual dari laporan JasperReports.\n• Anda dapat mendesain file ini secara visual (Drag & Drop) menggunakan software desktop **Jaspersoft Studio** (gratis) sebelum mengunggah berkas tersebut ke ShiFor.",
          "color": "#7c3aed",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style='font-family:system-ui;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(124,58,237,.1);border:1px solid #e9d5ff;background:#fff;width:300px;margin:0 auto;padding:12px'><div style='font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#6b21a8;margin-bottom:8px;text-align:center'>JRXML Design Flow</div><div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px'><div style='padding:8px;border-radius:8px;background:#f5f3ff;border:1px solid #e9d5ff'><div style='font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;margin-bottom:3px'>🎨 Jaspersoft Studio</div><div style='font-size:7px;color:#475569'>Visual designer (Drag & Drop)</div></div><div style='text-align:center;font-size:10px;color:#a78bfa'>↓</div><div style='padding:8px;border-radius:8px;background:#eff6ff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe'><div style='font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#1e40af;margin-bottom:3px'>📝 JRXML File</div><div style='font-size:7px;color:#475569;font-family:monospace'>report.jrxml (XML)</div></div><div style='text-align:center;font-size:10px;color:#a78bfa'>↓</div><div style='padding:8px;border-radius:8px;background:#dcfce7;border:1px solid #86efac'><div style='font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#166534;margin-bottom:3px'>🚀 Upload to ShiFor</div><div style='font-size:7px;color:#475569'>Max 3MB</div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Mengapa file JRXML saya ditolak oleh sistem saat diunggah?",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Beberapa penyebab kegagalan unggah berkas JRXML meliputi:\n  - Ukuran berkas melebihi batas maksimal **3MB**.\n  - Ekstensi berkas bukan berformat `.jrxml` atau `.xml`.\n  - Struktur XML di dalam berkas rusak atau mengandung referensi resource lokal (misalnya path gambar lokal seperti `C:\\images\\logo.png`) yang tidak dapat diakses oleh server ShiFor.",
          "color": "#10b981",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style='font-family:system-ui;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(16,185,129,.1);border:1px solid #a7f3d0;background:#fff;width:300px;margin:0 auto;padding:12px'><div style='font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#166534;margin-bottom:8px;text-align:center'>Upload Validation</div><div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px'><div style='padding:6px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#dcfce7;border:1px solid #86efac;display:flex;justify-content:space-between'><span style='font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#166534'>✓ Size < 3MB</span><span style='font-size:6px;color:#64748b'>Valid</span></div><div style='padding:6px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#dcfce7;border:1px solid #86efac;display:flex;justify-content:space-between'><span style='font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#166534'>✓ .jrxml / .xml</span><span style='font-size:6px;color:#64748b'>Valid</span></div><div style='padding:6px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#dcfce7;border:1px solid #86efac;display:flex;justify-content:space-between'><span style='font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#166534'>✓ XML structure</span><span style='font-size:6px;color:#64748b'>Valid</span></div><div style='padding:6px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#fee2e2;border:1px solid #fca5a5;display:flex;justify-content:space-between'><span style='font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#991b1b'>✗ Local paths</span><span style='font-size:6px;color:#64748b'>Invalid</span></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Bagaimana cara melakukan otomatisasi jadwal pada Jasper Report?",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Terdapat dua cara:\n  1. Menggunakan drawer **Report Engine Automation** saat pendaftaran pertama kali untuk menyusun konfigurasi info laporan dan jadwal otomatis secara langsung.\n  2. Mengklik tombol **Schedule Configuration / Edit Schedule** di bagian bawah detail panel tab General untuk laporan kustom yang sudah terdaftar di sistem.",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style='font-family:system-ui;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(245,158,11,.1);border:1px solid #fde68a;background:#fff;width:300px;margin:0 auto;padding:12px'><div style='font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#92400e;margin-bottom:8px;text-align:center'>Schedule Options</div><div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px'><div style='padding:8px;border-radius:8px;background:#fef3c7;border:1px solid #fde68a'><div style='font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#92400e;margin-bottom:3px'>Option 1: New Report</div><div style='font-size:7px;color:#475569'>Report Engine Automation drawer</div></div><div style='text-align:center;font-size:10px;color:#fbbf24'>atau</div><div style='padding:8px;border-radius:8px;background:#fef3c7;border:1px solid #fde68a'><div style='font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#92400e;margin-bottom:3px'>Option 2: Existing Report</div><div style='font-size:7px;color:#475569'>Schedule Configuration button</div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Di mana saya harus mendaftarkan email tujuan penerima laporan?",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Kontak penerima diambil dari data modul **Contact Setup** utama.\n• Daftarkan email investigator atau manager terlebih dahulu di modul **Contact Setup** dengan saluran platform **Email**, kemudian kembali ke modul Jasper Report untuk memilih email tersebut di dropdown **Recipients**.",
          "color": "#0ea5e9",
          "bg": "#f0f9ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style='font-family:system-ui;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(14,165,233,.1);border:1px solid #bae6fd;background:#fff;width:300px;margin:0 auto;padding:12px'><div style='font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#075985;margin-bottom:8px;text-align:center'>Recipients Setup</div><div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px'><div style='padding:6px;border-radius:6px;background:#f0f9ff;border:1px solid #bae6fd;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px'><div style='width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#0ea5e9;color:#fff;font-size:9px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center'>1</div><span style='font-size:8px;color:#0f172a'>Daftar di Contact Setup</span></div><div style='padding:6px;border-radius:6px;background:#f0f9ff;border:1px solid #bae6fd;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px'><div style='width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#0ea5e9;color:#fff;font-size:9px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center'>2</div><span style='font-size:8px;color:#0f172a'>Platform: Email</span></div><div style='padding:6px;border-radius:6px;background:#f0f9ff;border:1px solid #bae6fd;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px'><div style='width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#0ea5e9;color:#fff;font-size:9px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center'>3</div><span style='font-size:8px;color:#0f172a'>Pilih di Recipients dropdown</span></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 5,
          "title": "Bagaimana cara melihat riwayat unggahan berkas JRXML?",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Buka detail panel laporan kustom Anda, lalu klik tab **History**.\n• Di sini, sistem menyajikan log kronologis audit trail lengkap dengan inisiator (email pelaksana), penanda waktu, pesan status, serta detail perbandingan nilai lama dan nilai baru dalam accordion **Previous Value** dan **New Value**.",
          "color": "#ec4899",
          "bg": "#fdf2f8",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style='font-family:system-ui;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(236,72,153,.1);border:1px solid #fbcfe8;background:#fff;width:300px;margin:0 auto;padding:12px'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px'><span style='font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#9f1239'>JRXML Upload History</span><span style='padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#fdf2f8;font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#9f1239'>AUDIT</span></div><div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px'><div style='border-left:2px solid #10b981;padding-left:8px'><div style='font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#166534'>UPLOADED</div><div style='font-size:7px;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px'>by admin • 2024-01-10</div><div style='font-size:6px;color:#475569;margin-top:2px;background:#f1f5f9;padding:3px;border-radius:3px'>report_v1.jrxml</div></div><div style='border-left:2px solid #3b82f6;padding-left:8px'><div style='font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#1e40af'>UPDATED</div><div style='font-size:7px;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px'>by developer • 2024-01-15</div><div style='font-size:6px;color:#475569;margin-top:2px;background:#f1f5f9;padding:3px;border-radius:3px'>report_v2.jrxml</div></div></div></div>"
